[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]
script = ExtResource("8")
text = "The Grauwald road climbs a gorge to a fort on the saddle. Past the saddle, Iron's mountains open all the way to Kharn."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]
script = ExtResource("8")
speaker = &"iris_colt"
text = "Vance has guns in both height forts. Anything on that road gets shelled from above, so we climb."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]
script = ExtResource("8")
speaker = &"iona_vance"
text = "Colt. Your column is mostly foot and all of it downhill of me. I've run the numbers for you and they aren't close."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]
script = ExtResource("8")
speaker = &"ines_calder"
text = "Look for my hill companies on the third day, coming off the goat paths south of the gorge with more boots than rifles."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]
script = ExtResource("8")
speaker = &"gideon_holt"
text = "I have fuel for four days of mountain driving or two of driving into artillery, and I know which one I'm writing on the requisition."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]
script = ExtResource("8")
speaker = &"iris_colt"
text = "The saddle's ours. Get a flag on that fort where her spotters can see it."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_29"]
script = ExtResource("8")
speaker = &"iona_vance"
text = "Withdrawn in order, most of the garrison intact. Tell Mara Voss the Ninth climbs better than it used to."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_30"]
script = ExtResource("8")
speaker = &"gideon_holt"
text = "One fort, and the road below it never got shelled with us on it. The fuel's all accounted for. I'm almost suspicious."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_31"]
script = ExtResource("8")
speaker = &"iona_vance"
text = "The pass holds. Colt spent her column on my gorge and I spent two shells a minute."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_32"]
script = ExtResource("8")
speaker = &"gideon_holt"
text = "We drove up the one road she'd ranged. Next time I hide the fuel until somebody picks another."

